    /* CHIPCOMMONA_CHIPCTRL      */ "The 4-byte Chip Control register is writable, has a device-specific reset value, and contains control bits used for chip-dependent purposes. Use of this register has been deprecated in favor of the ChipControl registers in the PMU.",
