    /* CHIPCOMMONA_CLKDIV        */ "The 4-byte Clock Divider register is writable, has a device-dependent reset value, and controls the clock frequencies generated by chipcommon internal clock dividers.",
    /* CHIPCOMMONA_CLKDIV2       */ "The 4-byte Clock Divider2 register is writable, has a device-dependent reset value, and controls the clock frequencies generated by chipcommon internal clock dividers.",
    /* CHIPCOMMONA_CLOCKCTLSTATUS */ "The four-byte ClockCtlStatus register is writable and contains a device-specific value at device reset. This register provides mechanisms for software to communicate with the device's Power Management Unit (PMU). See CurrentPmuProgGuide for more information on clock control and power states",
