    /* CNG1COSDROPRATE           */ "DROPRATE: Options for drop rate of Simple RED when packet count is over cos' CNG1 limit.\n0: 100% cliff drop\n1:  6.25%\n2:  3.125%\n3:  1.5625%\n4:  0.78125%\n5:  0.390625%\n6:  0.1953125%\n7:  0.09215625%",
    /* CNGCOSCELLLIMIT0          */ "CNGCELLSETLIMIT: CNG0 Set Limit for COS n for an egress port.\nThis set limit is in the granuality of 8 cells.\nWhen cell count is above this limit, incoming packet carried congestion\ncolor red (CNG[1:0]==2'b01) or color yellow(CNG[1:0]==2'b11), when\nSIMPLEREDCONFIG is set to 1, will be dropped. Packet drop rate is config by\nCNGDROPRATE  registers. This limit is needed to be set lower than\nLWMCOSCELLSETLIMIT of the same port to ensure dropping CNG0 packet\nmechanism will take effect earlier than HO ...",
