    /* EGRMETERINGCONFIG1        */ "REFRESH: Refresh count for port based egr meter bucket.\n            |                  Refresh Range\ngranularity  | Min (refresh = 1) <-> Max (refresh = 0x3ffff)\n------------+--------------------+--------------------------\n1/128 Byte  |        8,000 bps     |    2,097.144M bps\n 1/64 Byte  |       16,000 bps     |    4,194.288M bps\n 1/32 Byte  |       32,000 bps     |    8,388.576M bps\n 1/16 Byte  |       64,000 bps     |     16,777.152M bps\n 1/8  Byte  |      128,000 bps     |     33,554.304M bp ...",
    /* EGRMETERINGCONFIG_64      */ "THD_SEL: Threshold determines the size of Shaping Bucket.\nThis Threshold setting is not related to actual bandwidth rate number.\nWhen ITU mode is not enabled,\nThe Bucket size ranges from 4k Bytes to 16M Bytes with 4k Bytes increment\nThe Bucket size is determined by the formula,\nBucketSize = MIN_THD_SEL * 4KBytes\nMin Bucket function is disabled when bucket size is 0.\nWhen ITU mode is enabled,\nThreshold is divided into two fields.\nW1 = MIN_THD_SEL[11:8]\nW2 = MIN_THD_SEL[7:0]\nThe Bucket size is det ...",
