    /* MHOST_0_CSATBFUNNEL_DEVTYPE */ "It provides a debugger with information about the component when the Part Number field is not recognized. The debugger can then report this information.",
    /* MHOST_0_CSATBFUNNEL_ITATBCTR0 */ "The Integration Test ATB Control 0 Register performs different functions depending on whether the access is a read or a write:\n    * a write sets the value of the atvalidm.\n    * a read returns the value of the atvalidsn signals, where n is defined by the status of the Control register at 0x000.",
