    /* NBIH_RX_SCH_CONFIG_HRF    */ "Configuration Register of Rx HRFs mapping in the SCH block.\n                   HRFs 0..1 are for PMH HRF data controller.\n                   HRFs 2..3 are for PMH HRF TDM controller.\n                   HRFs 4..5 are for PML0 HRF data controller.\n                   HRFs 6..7 are for PML0 HRF TDM controller.\n                   HRFs 8..9 are for PML1 HRF data controller.\n                   HRFs 10..11 are for PML1 HRF TDM controller.",
