    /* NIF_FC_TX_GEN_LLFC_FROM_CFC_OCB_MASK */ "CPU overrides for LLFC indications. If set, will enable indications from CFC to PM or CFC to generate LLFC indication (TxGenLLFC) from the cfc2nif LLFC OCB indication. Otherwise, indications from the CFC are ignored Each bit corresponds to ETH port. Bit 0 corresponds to ethernet port on serdes 0; bit 35 corresponds to eth port on serdes 35.",
    /* NIF_FC_TX_GEN_LLFC_FROM_NPM_MASK */ "If set, will enable indications from NPM (NIF Port Metering) to PM or CFC to generate LLFC indication (TxGenLLFC). Otherwise, indications from the RxMLF are ignored. Each bit corresponds to ETH port . Bit 0 corresponds to ethernet port on serdes 0; bit 35 corresponds to eth port on serdes 35.",
