    /* NIF_NBI_PKT_DROP_COUNTERS_75P_INTERRUPT_REGISTER */ "Indicates one of the PktDropCounterRx counters of ports 0-35 has reached 75% of its maximal value and should be read to prevent overflow. ThePktDropCounterRx counters count the number of SoP that were discarded due to RX FIFO full.\n To clear this interrupt, the relevant counter should be read.",
