    /* NIF_PM_ACCUMULATE_AND_SYNC_CYCLE_NUM */ "In order to synchronize events  (such as credits, eob..) a block called nbi_accumulate_and _sync  is used. This block accumulates the event for defined number of cycles and then synchronize the accumulated value to core clock.  This register defines the number of accumulating cycles.\n Since all the PMH PMs use the same clock, one configuration is used for all PMs.",
