    /* NIF_RX_PKT_FC_ERR_COUNTER */ "Per RX port counter for flow control packets that are marked with error  (pause frames or PFC or Mac control). These packets will be sent to the IRE. NBI cant drop these packets because fc indication arrives after more than 64B, so the packet is already written to the FIFO. We drop . Register 0 corresponds to nif port 0. Register 23 corresponds to nif port 23.",
    /* NIF_RX_PORTS_SRSTN        */ "Rx MLF Reset. Active low reset for RMC of NIF ports 0-35. Bit 0 for port 0; bit 35 for port 35. It also resets the per-port transaction counter in SCH.\n\n Note: corresponding ports should be configured before changing this reset.",
