    /* NIF_RX_PRD_VLAN_ETHERTYPE */ "Ethertype to compare to if the traffic is VLAN. If the Ethertype of the packet equals one of those values, the keys to take the priority from is taken from the packet (4 MSBs of Byte14). Otherwise, the key is taken from the register PrdUntagPcp.",
