    /* NIF_TX_ERROR_FROM_MEM_DIDNT_PROPAGATE */ "Debug register. Inidcates error from the memory didn't propagate to the port-macro at least once. This is relevant for error initiate, where is some cases the memory is read, but the data is not used. This data will be used next time the memory is read, but another initiate is required. Not relevant for errors from the EGQ or real soft errors in the memory.",
