    /* TCAM_TCAM_PROTECTION_2_BIT_ECC_HANDLING_DONE */ "TCAM Protection will no longer invalidate the 2bit ECC corrupted entries at the TCAM Banks. Instead the User will take full resposibility. When TCAM Protection finds a 2bit ECC corrupted entry it will pause the Protection Operation, raise an interrupt at KTM.TcamProtectionErr2bitEcc with additional information for bank and entry at TcamProtectionError. The User needs to handle the 2bit corruption as wanted and update the TCAM Bank if needed. Then to notify the TCAM it can continue its work 1'b1  ...",
